# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and releases use calendar versions in `YYYY.MM.DD` format.

## [2026.10.22] - 2026-10-22

### Added

- Hand retargeting with q-method bone-end initialization, complementary pinch/shape tasks, bone directions, wrist and joint motion priors, and analytic Jacobians.
- ProxQP and Dogbox backends for bounded nonlinear least squares, with ProxQP enabled by default.
- Quest/WebXR input with HTTPS, session configuration, recording, and combined robot and tracked-skeleton visualization.
- Revo2 and Wuji Hand models for both hands, with Revo2 position/time control through the arm controller SDK.
- Input/output adapter interfaces and adaptation skills, packaged model assets, bilingual documentation, and MIT licensing with bundled model license notices.
